! kind streams settings

<div class="rr-settings">

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/rimir/kind-streams/enable" field="text" checked="yes" unchecked="no" default="yes">
&nbsp;''Show the kind pill on typed Streams nodes''
</$checkbox>

When enabled, every Streams node that has a `kind.type` shows a collapsed type pill in the outline; expanding it reveals kind's field bar. When disabled, nodes render normally and you can still assign types via the right-click ''Kind type…'' menu.

!! Related kind settings

The in-node field bar reuses kind's own configuration:

* `$:/config/rimir/kind/streambar-max-length` — max characters shown per field cell before truncation.
* `$:/config/rimir/kind/active-namespace` — restricts which kind types the assign dialog offers.

</div>
